(7548404, 1208757, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful building!</td>', 'Beautiful building!', '2017-12-14 20:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7548407, 1209037, 173844, '<td valign="top">Here are vertical blinds with shadow cast on them.  They are soft and subtle, a blossoming of tones among the stripes, pleasant and haunting.  Before the curtain is raised the show has begun.  Wonderful image.</td>', 'Here are vertical blinds with shadow cast on them.  They are soft and subtle, a blossoming of tones among the stripes, pleasant and haunting.  Before the curtain is raised the show has begun.  Wonderful image.', '2017-12-14 22:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7548408, 1208723, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely high key portrait that is gracefully presented within the confines of a square crop.  Her expression is mild, her eyes liquid (aside from the static of reflection).  I like that her hair hasn''t been primped and beautifully catches the light.  It doesn''t hurt that I see my sister in her.  Aside from that last comment, a wonderful image.</td>', 'Lovely high key portrait that is gracefully presented within the confines of a square crop.  Her expression is mild, her eyes liquid (aside from the static of reflection).  I like that her hair hasn''t been primped and beautifully catches the light.  It doesn''t hurt that I see my sister in her.  Aside from that last comment, a wonderful image.', '2017-12-14 22:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7548409, 1209076, 173844, '<td valign="top">One of those in between moments that stitch the day together.  As such, perfectly caught with artful precision.</td>', 'One of those in between moments that stitch the day together.  As such, perfectly caught with artful precision.', '2017-12-14 22:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7548411, 1208659, 173844, '<td valign="top">This image has a ying-yang thing going, with a contemplative cat sitting on the middle line, and the luscious gold and blue halves in peaceful opposition.  There''s an indolence too, a mystical stroll outside time.  The square format works well, especially the sense of squaring the circle.  Fine photograph.</td>', 'This image has a ying-yang thing going, with a contemplative cat sitting on the middle line, and the luscious gold and blue halves in peaceful opposition.  There''s an indolence too, a mystical stroll outside time.  The square format works well, especially the sense of squaring the circle.  Fine photograph.', '2017-12-14 22:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7548412, 1208882, 173844, '<td valign="top">A chap what knows knows his own mind, seems to be thinking, "where do you get off..."  Or else is going to break into a wide grin.  In any case, a strong character.  I like how he fills the square frame in his offhand manner.  A substantial portrait.</td>', 'A chap what knows knows his own mind, seems to be thinking, "where do you get off..."  Or else is going to break into a wide grin.  In any case, a strong character.  I like how he fills the square frame in his offhand manner.  A substantial portrait.', '2017-12-14 22:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7548413, 1209051, 173844, '<td valign="top">Very pretty and, an adjective that comes reluctantly into print, organic.  Seductively pretty, like marvelous tile work.  It''s a great pleasure to just allow the colors to lap over oneself.  My only quibble is that it seems somewhat awkward in the square format.</td>', 'Very pretty and, an adjective that comes reluctantly into print, organic.  Seductively pretty, like marvelous tile work.  It''s a great pleasure to just allow the colors to lap over oneself.  My only quibble is that it seems somewhat awkward in the square format.', '2017-12-14 23:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7548414, 1208855, 173844, '<td valign="top">This looks like the opening sentence of a charming tale, place and atmosphere set out for the reader.  It''s that feeling of unfolding, from particular to the unknown fog of the outcome.  It''s a very enjoyable image, and the square format is quite cleverly utilized.  I find the lamp a bit distracting, but that''s just a subjective quibble, and that''s how the scene appears.</td>', 'This looks like the opening sentence of a charming tale, place and atmosphere set out for the reader.  It''s that feeling of unfolding, from particular to the unknown fog of the outcome.  It''s a very enjoyable image, and the square format is quite cleverly utilized.  I find the lamp a bit distracting, but that''s just a subjective quibble, and that''s how the scene appears.', '2017-12-14 23:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7548415, 1208673, 173844, '<td valign="top">An unstudied glance, calm and direct, that captivates the viewer.  The blocks of blue and red steady the image admirably, and the composition as a whole is interestingly balanced.  Good image.</td>', 'An unstudied glance, calm and direct, that captivates the viewer.  The blocks of blue and red steady the image admirably, and the composition as a whole is interestingly balanced.  Good image.', '2017-12-14 23:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7548416, 1209036, 173844, '<td valign="top">A serene and modest unfolding of receding planes draws the eye through the foreground to the misted mountains beyond.  The colors are harmonious.  The square format works wonderfully here, embracing the open expanse of sky.  A quiet delight.</td>', 'A serene and modest unfolding of receding planes draws the eye through the foreground to the misted mountains beyond.  The colors are harmonious.  The square format works wonderfully here, embracing the open expanse of sky.  A quiet delight.', '2017-12-14 23:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7548417, 1208679, 173844, '<td valign="top">Graphically impressive.  I know I''m looking up into the sky, but it also feels like I''m looking down through the clouds and into the ocean.  The illusion is quite enjoyable.</td>', 'Graphically impressive.  I know I''m looking up into the sky, but it also feels like I''m looking down through the clouds and into the ocean.  The illusion is quite enjoyable.', '2017-12-14 23:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7548418, 1209043, 173844, '<td valign="top">The rich colors and elegant Santa hold the eye in pleasure.  The square crop very nicely frames this happy portrait.  Really conveys the spirit of the season.</td>', 'The rich colors and elegant Santa hold the eye in pleasure.  The square crop very nicely frames this happy portrait.  Really conveys the spirit of the season.', '2017-12-14 23:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7548419, 1209050, 173844, '<td valign="top">Busy, busy, but I want to take in every detail.  This is about light and shadow, the structure that undergirds the passing moment.  I like the square within the square, the rhythm it establishes.  Lovely image.</td>', 'Busy, busy, but I want to take in every detail.  This is about light and shadow, the structure that undergirds the passing moment.  I like the square within the square, the rhythm it establishes.  Lovely image.', '2017-12-14 23:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7548421, 1209064, 173844, '<td valign="top">She''s a subtle jewel, deliberately hidden, but it doesn''t matter.  It''s nice how she sits within the woody columns.  The title is wonderful, making it all so much so.  The square format is perfect.  Quite appealing.</td>', 'She''s a subtle jewel, deliberately hidden, but it doesn''t matter.  It''s nice how she sits within the woody columns.  The title is wonderful, making it all so much so.  The square format is perfect.  Quite appealing.', '2017-12-14 23:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7548422, 1208596, 173844, '<td valign="top">Quirky line of houses, like individual people, and the reflections that reveal their inner being.  Fills the frame in a pleasing manner.</td>', 'Quirky line of houses, like individual people, and the reflections that reveal their inner being.  Fills the frame in a pleasing manner.', '2017-12-14 23:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7548424, 1208930, 173844, '<td valign="top">She absolutely brightens up the street with her casual playfulness.  A charming moment that, because of the quick work of the artist, can be shared and treasured.  She''s in her own world.  And what great eyebrows.  Fine image.</td>', 'She absolutely brightens up the street with her casual playfulness.  A charming moment that, because of the quick work of the artist, can be shared and treasured.  She''s in her own world.  And what great eyebrows.  Fine image.', '2017-12-14 23:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
